    <releaseNotes>New Features and Improvements

* New package available under the name OmniPage OCR. It includes the OmniPage OCR activity and can be used with the Basic (included by default) or the Extended bundles (available to install from the feed).


For the complete release notes, please visit https://activities.uipath.com/docs/release-notes-omnipageocr.</releaseNotes>
